* Value of Nfloor (Mathlib's Nat.floor): the integer floor for nonnegative arguments, 0 otherwise.

s1::id |- ( x = X -> x = X )
c1:s1:breq1d |- ( x = X -> ( x < 0 <-> X < 0 ) )
